{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scarf of Embers</strong> is a 3D action-platformer inspired by the classics. Leap across floating islands, collect gems, and take down mischievous Imps with fast-paced hack\u2019n\u2019slash combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Mandy</strong>, a young witch of shadow and fire. Armed with her broom, a magical scarf, and a growing arsenal of spells, she sets out to rescue her lost friend and protect a world whose magic is being stolen by chaos-loving Imps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combat is fluid, freeform, and stylish, chain broom strikes, scarf slashes, and fiery spells into your own combos on the fly. Explore vibrant levels, discover secrets, and use movement tricks straight out of a platforming golden age.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5.5</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>deferred renderer, baked lighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack\u2019n\u2019slash/platformer style (so not ultra-open-world scale)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889980?t=1760457595","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/053679b6291f4f16b6e7dfea8c70c88e6bad2de9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760457595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/f76401d8ef0e71d87f0962597a84a9ddfb9c6287/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760457595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/f76401d8ef0e71d87f0962597a84a9ddfb9c6287/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760457595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scarf of Embers</strong> is a 3D action-platformer inspired by the classics. Leap across floating islands, collect gems, and take down mischievous Imps with fast-paced hack\u2019n\u2019slash combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/f844ca6c353c7df70330b04b426d6767.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Mandy</strong>, a young witch of shadow and fire. Armed with her broom, a magical scarf, and a growing arsenal of spells, she sets out to rescue her lost friend and protect a world whose magic is being stolen by chaos-loving Imps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/2e2bf71b682146d38a895259c92a2f7d.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combat is fluid, freeform, and stylish, chain broom strikes, scarf slashes, and fiery spells into your own combos on the fly. Explore vibrant levels, discover secrets, and use movement tricks straight out of a platforming golden age.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.poster.avif?t=1760457595\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.webm?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/extras/0aa667d62aa2bf44b1f1227acb8efa61.mp4?t=1760457595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in <strong>Unreal Engine 5.5</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using <strong>deferred renderer, baked lighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack\u2019n\u2019slash/platformer style (so not ultra-open-world scale)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Hinges"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889980/73fa67d3bec810494afb81dc44cb4c0cef81a5e0/header.jpg?t=1760457595","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3889980/674860304/38512751a42a7e1c4d2ac56ae8b26d6358b13b7b/1759509204/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760457592","dash